{"id":"B2-L178","title":"Expectation (be supposed to) — form","cefr":"B2","level":"B2","unit":"B2-U11","focus":"Expectativa (be supposed to) — forma","targets":{"grammar":"Expectativa (be supposed to) — forma","pron":"Flap T americano","verbs":["overcome"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["safety training","training schedule","room readiness","lab entry rule","missing forms","overdue paperwork","team member","lab induction","first-aid kit","emergency shower","eye-wash station","glove box","hazard sign","sign-off sheet","compliance course","delay apology","room change","boring session","mandatory attendance","training certificate"],"field":"Ciência","genre":"E-mail, carta, mensagem","skill":"Escuta","words_min":20},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 178 · Expectation (be supposed to) — form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Expectativa (be supposed to) — forma.","**Verbos:** overcome.","**Pronúncia:** Flap T americano.","**20 palavras novas** (ciência).","**Texto do dia:** e-mail, carta, mensagem."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B2):** eu consigo usar be supposed to para falar de planos, regras e expectativas num e-mail de laboratório e usar overcome."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["safety training","treinamento de segurança"],["training schedule","cronograma de treinamento"],["room readiness","sala pronta"],["lab entry rule","regra de entrada no laboratório"],["missing forms","formulários ausentes"],["overdue paperwork","papelada atrasada"],["team member","membro da equipe"],["lab induction","indução ao laboratório"],["first-aid kit","kit de primeiros socorros"],["emergency shower","chuveiro de emergência"],["eye-wash station","estação lava-olhos"],["glove box","caixa de luvas"],["hazard sign","placa de perigo"],["sign-off sheet","folha de assinatura"],["compliance course","curso de conformidade"],["delay apology","pedido de desculpas pelo atraso"],["room change","mudança de sala"],["boring session","sessão chata"],["mandatory attendance","presença obrigatória"],["training certificate","certificado de treinamento"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An email","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"ana@lab.org","to":"team@lab.org","subject":"Reminder: safety training","paras":["Hi team,","The training **is supposed to** start at nine, but the room isn’t ready. You **aren’t supposed to** enter the lab without goggles. Tom **was supposed to** bring the forms; he forgot.","We **are all supposed to** attend, even if it’s boring. Let’s **overcome** the delays together! Ana"],"gloss":[["goggles","óculos de proteção"],["forms","formulários"],["overcome","superar"],["boring","chato"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The training is supposed to start at nine.","ans":"T","why":"at nine."},{"q":"Staff are allowed to enter without goggles.","ans":"F","why":"aren’t supposed to."},{"q":"Tom brought the forms.","ans":"F","why":"forgot."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“overcome” = ?","opts":["superar","sobrecarregar","cobrir"],"ans":0,"why":"overcome."},{"q":"“goggles” = ?","opts":["óculos de proteção","gogó","golfinho"],"ans":0,"why":"goggles."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"be supposed to — forma","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Forma","Exemplo"],"rows":[["afirmativa (plano)","The class **is supposed to** start at nine."],["negativa (regra)","You **aren’t supposed to** run."],["passado (não aconteceu)","Tom **was supposed to** bring forms."],["pergunta","**Are** we **supposed to** wear goggles?"]],"cap":"be supposed to — forma"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**be supposed to** = esperado/combinado: **plano** (*is supposed to start*), **regra** (*aren’t supposed to*), ou **algo que deveria ter ocorrido** (*was supposed to…*). Difere de **must**: soa menos forte."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"The training ___ supposed to start at nine. (be)","a":"is","why":"be supposed to."},{"s":"You aren’t ___ to enter without goggles. (suppose, part.)","a":"supposed","why":"supposed to."},{"s":"Tom ___ supposed to bring the forms. (be, past)","a":"was","why":"passado."},{"s":"Let’s ___ the delays together! (overcome)","a":"overcome","why":"verbo."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["safety training","treinamento de segurança"],["training schedule","cronograma de treinamento"],["room readiness","sala pronta"],["safety goggles","óculos de segurança"],["lab entry rule","regra de entrada no laboratório"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["the","room","isn't","ready","Yes","but"],"ans":"Yes but the room isn't ready","pt":"Sim, mas a sala não está pronta."},{"words":["to","wear","goggles","Are","we","supposed"],"ans":"Are we supposed to wear goggles","pt":"Devemos usar óculos?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"safety training","pos":"word","pt":"treinamento de segurança","ex":"Safety training.","expt":"Treinamento de segurança."},{"w":"training schedule","pos":"word","pt":"cronograma de treinamento","ex":"Training schedule.","expt":"Cronograma de treinamento."},{"w":"room readiness","pos":"word","pt":"sala pronta","ex":"Room readiness.","expt":"Sala pronta."},{"w":"lab entry rule","pos":"word","pt":"regra de entrada no laboratório","ex":"Lab entry rule.","expt":"Regra de entrada no laboratório."},{"w":"missing forms","pos":"word","pt":"formulários ausentes","ex":"Missing forms.","expt":"Formulários ausentes."}